Collects, collates and analyzes data from the Authority and makes appropriate recommendations thereof;
Analyses the provision of goods and services emanating from the Authority and initiates appropriate action;
Monitors the implementation of existing Supply Chain Management policies, guidelines and procedures;
Disposes unserviceable stores; and implements the activities of the Authority of Survey on disposing items.
