Senior Estates Officer (Marketing & Valuation)
The Estates Division’s main purpose is that of managing all NHC-developed projects and properties. Its overall responsibility includes administration maintenance and undertaking repair works of all Corporation schemes and properties, regional coordination, marketing, and sales of NHC developed houses as well as carrying out valuations, feasibility, and market studies for the Corporation.
Reporting to the General Manager Estates, the Senior Estates Officer will be responsible for the management and administration of NHC developed properties and assets, including those repossessed from various local authorities, in collaboration with all other divisions of the Corporation. The officer will also be responsible for valuation and marketing, estate management, maintenance, and regional coordination. He/she will:
