Demonstrable experience in advocacy and campaigns on women’s rights and governance programming;
Demonstrable experience in building capacity of partners and staff on Disaster Response, Risk reduction and resilience building;
Experience of managing partnership relationships; and
Understanding of different donor requirements and ways of working.
